[真根因]
- app-builder-lib@26.15.3 用 @electron/get@3.0.0 的 ElectronDownloadCacheMode.ReadWrite
- @electron/get@3.0.0 不导出这个 enum (只有 Cache class)
- electron-builder 26.15.3 内部 bug - v3.0.0 兼容性破坏

[PM-direct 12:30 手动成功方案]
1. 下 Electron 40.10.2 darwin-arm64 zip 从 npmmirror
2. 解压到 apps/desktop/node_modules/electron/dist/Electron.app
3. 设 CUSTOM_DMGBUILD_PATH=<dmgbuild bundle dir>/dmgbuild
4. 跑 pnpm dist:mac exit 0

[R130 自动化]
- _http_download: 流式下载 npmmirror binary
- _resolve_node_modules_dir: parent-dir walk for pnpm hoisted electron
- _ensure_electron_dist: 下 Electron zip + atomic extract (fast path skip if version 文件 在)
- _ensure_dmgbuild: 下 dmg-builder@1.2.5.tar.gz + tarfile extract (fast path scan existing dir)
- build_and_stage_macos_release:
  - _ensure_electron_dist() 预 stage
  - _ensure_dmgbuild() 预 stage + 返 path
  - 设 CUSTOM_DMGBUILD_PATH extra_env to _run_update_build_step

